  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 4302.10 Gallon",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4302.10 “Gallon” means a liquid measure that is not corrected for temperature and that contains 231 cubic inches or the equivalent of 4 ¼ pounds of propane or 100 cubic feet of natural gas. The term includes “gross gallons”.\n\nSource. #9376, eff 1-30-09; ss by #10026, eff 11-16-11 (from Saf-C 4302.06); ss by #13037, eff 4-20-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c4300.html"
